.IP "test2_add_callback_context_release(sub { ... })" 4
.IX Item "test2_add_callback_context_release(sub { ... })"
.PD 0
.ie n .IP "my $ctx_ref = shift" 4
.el .IP "my \f(CW$ctx_ref\fR = shift" 4
.IX Item "my $ctx_ref = shift"
.PD
The coderefs for \fBtest2_add_callback_context_release()\fR will receive exactly 1
argument, the context being released.
.IP "print ""Context was released\en""" 4
